        "original_id": "07a20b19-2267-5e45-8aac-727be3ddefca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rosi Golan\n- Companies: Chicco, Artsana, Pantene, J. C. Penney, Walmart\n- Products: children's products\n- Works: Dear John, Tiger Eyes, Vampire Diaries, Grey's Anatomy, Private Practice, Brothers & Sisters, One Tree Hill, Ghost Whisperer\n- Topics: song placements, advertising\n\nFacts:\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been featured in the feature films \"Dear John\" and \"Tiger Eyes\".\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been featured in the TV shows \"Vampire Diaries,\" \"Grey's Anatomy,\" \"Private Practice,\" \"Brothers & Sisters,\" \"One Tree Hill,\" and \"Ghost Whisperer.\"\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been featured in commercials for Chicco, Pantene, J. C. Penney, and Walmart.\n- Chicco is a brand of Artsana.\n- Chicco has worked in the field of children's products for over 50 years.\n- Chicco is present in more than 120 countries worldwide.",
